# Line endings: the repository stores every text file with LF and that is what every
# clone should check out. This overrides core.autocrlf on Windows clones, which would
# otherwise convert to CRLF on checkout and warn ("LF will be replaced by CRLF") on
# every LF file written by an editor or tool. PowerShell, Markdown, JSON and CSV are
# all fine with LF on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary content: never touch line endings.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.pfx  binary
*.cer  binary
